      "question": "dv105a_group_1_names",
      "why": "DV-105(A) comes in only when DV-105 item 4a is answered No, so its first question is asked whenever the form is here. It follows item 4a only because that is the question before it."
    },
    {
      "question": "dv105a_group_1_home_1_lived_with",
      "why": "Every row of the table asks who the children lived with, including the rows that follow the confidential-address box. That box is about the current address only."
    },
    {
      "question": "dv105a_group_1_home_2_asked",
      "why": "Whether there is an earlier address does not depend on whether the current one is confidential. It follows that box only because the box is the last thing the first row asks."
    },
